    "body": "Right, 3.7 is the thing to be replaced.  That is, [CEReactions] does not actually change anything webidl itself does; just changes what the \"actions listed in the description of attribute that occur on setting\" are.\r\n\r\n@domenic's plan sounds good to me.",
